---
// Scene 1 version "blobs": the original 2.0 hero art. Two soft colour glows
// behind centred copy, no motion. The fallback: point HomeHero's HeroScene
// import here to undo any other version.
//
// Contract for every version in this folder:
// - Render the default slot (HomeHero's h1 and CTAs) exactly once, unchanged.
//   Everything else inside the hero section is the version's own.
// - Art is decorative: aria-hidden, nothing focusable, palette tokens only.
// - Motion follows the motion layer's contract (components/motion/): gated
//   on html[data-motion="ok"], and the markup without motion is the final
//   frame, so reduced motion, scripts off and print all get the finished
//   scene.
// - Anything worth tuning (timing, counts, colours, placement) sits in one
//   settings const at the top of the frontmatter.
---
<div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-24 -left-24 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-glow-cool/50 blur-3xl"></div>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-10 right-0 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-highlight/40 blur-3xl"></div>
<div class="relative max-w-content mx-auto px-gutter py-hero text-center">
  <slot />
</div>
